      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْحًي</span></b>  <i>A place of a mill</i> or <i>mill-stone.</i> (MA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحًي</span> (near the end of the paragraph),
in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Accord. to Freytag, it occurs
in the Deewán of the Hudhalees as meaning (assumed tropical:)  <i>A
place where any one stands firmly.</i>]

